  - the image is built from the Dockerfile in this repo (build: .), which adds
    the Common AI Provider to apache/airflow:3.3.2
  - AIRFLOW__CORE__LOAD_EXAMPLES set to 'false'
  - AIRFLOW__CORE__TEST_CONNECTION set to 'Enabled'
  - AIRFLOW__CORE__FERNET_KEY read from the environment
  - AIRFLOW__CORE__ALLOWED_DESERIALIZATION_CLASSES set to allow globoticket_models
  - the assets/ directory mounted read-only at /opt/airflow/assets
  - a globoticket-pg PostgreSQL 16 service for the event catalog
